CommitDate: Fri Sep 25 08:41:18 2026 +0800

    fix: close process and browser lifecycle leaks
    
    Retain process ownership through cleanup, guard descendant discovery against PID reuse, and preserve interruption and primary failures. Bound browser and journey resource lifecycles with cancellation-safe cleanup and regression coverage.

